## 📌 Overview

**CV Optimeter AI** is an open-source, production-ready SaaS platform engineered to optimize resumes using Artificial Intelligence and Applicant Tracking System (ATS) parsing algorithms. 

It helps job candidates maximize interview conversion rates by auditing resumes against 5 core ATS pillars, providing STAR-framework bullet point rewrites, gap-analyzing job descriptions, generating tailored cover letters, and optimizing LinkedIn profiles.

---

## ✨ Key Features

- 📄 **Multi-Format Document Parsing:** Instant text, contact details, and section extraction from PDF, DOCX, and TXT files.
- 🎯 **ATS Scoring Engine (0-100):** Comprehensive audit across Action Verbs, Measurable Metrics, Hard Skills Density, Formatting Structure, and Brevity.
- 🪄 **AI STAR Bullet Rewriter:** Automatically transforms weak experience bullet points into high-impact STAR (Situation, Task, Action, Result) achievements with metrics.
- 🔍 **Job Description Matcher:** Side-by-side keyword overlap analysis detecting missing hard/soft skills and fit percentage.
- ✉️ **AI Cover Letter Generator:** Crafts personalized, high-converting cover letters tailored to target companies and roles.
- 💼 **LinkedIn Profile Optimizer:** Generates executive headlines, About summaries, and featured skill matrices.
- 📊 **Analytics & Metrics Dashboard:** Interactive charts built with Recharts tracking score progression and impact statistics.
- 🕒 **Version Control & Revisions:** Revision logging allowing side-by-side comparison and past iteration restoring.
- 📥 **Export Studio:** Downloads optimized resumes in clean HTML, DOCX, and printable vector PDF formats.

