## 🛠️ Technology Stack

### Frontend
- **Framework:** Next.js 14 (App Router, TypeScript)
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS (Dark/Light Glassmorphism)
- **UI Components & Icons:** Lucide Icons, Framer Motion, Recharts

### Backend
- **Framework:** FastAPI (Python 3.11+)
- **Parser Engine:** `pypdf`, `python-docx`
- **AI & NLP:** Dual Engine (OpenAI GPT-4o API integration + Local NLP Rule Fallback)
- **Data Validation:** Pydantic v2

### Infrastructure & Database
- **Database:** PostgreSQL (SQLAlchemy)
- **Cache:** Redis
- **Containerization:** Docker & Docker Compose

---

## 🏗️ System Architecture

```mermaid
graph TD
    User([Candidate / Client Browser]) -->|HTTPS REST API| Frontend[Next.js 14 Web App\nTypeScript + Tailwind]
    
    subgraph FastAPI Core Engine
        Frontend -->|JSON Requests| API[FastAPI Server\nPython 3.11]
        API --> Parser[Document Parser\nPDF / DOCX Extractor]
        API --> ATS[ATS Scoring Engine\n5 Pillar Matrix Engine]
        API --> AI[AI Engine\nGPT-4o + Local NLP Fallback]
        API --> Export[Export Studio\nHTML / DOCX / PDF]
    end

    subgraph Infrastructure
        API --> DB[(PostgreSQL Database)]
        API --> Cache[(Redis Cache / Tasks)]
    end
```

